.TH SYSINFO 1 "August 2026" "sysinfo 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sysinfo \- print a concise Linux system information summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sysinfo
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sysinfo
prints the current system load, root filesystem usage, memory and swap use,
process count, established SSH connection count, non-link-local network
addresses, and system uptime.
.PP
It is an independent POSIX shell utility with an output style inspired by
landscape-sysinfo. It neither requires nor communicates with Landscape.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /proc/loadavg
Current load average.
.TP
.I /proc/meminfo
Memory statistics.
.TP
.I /proc/uptime
System uptime.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 after printing the summary.
.SH AUTHOR
Jacek Stypuła.
